OL,3,GNEWSANo further police investigation
OL,4,Ainto Yes Scotland finances
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say they have found nothing to
OL,7,Fwarrant further investigation following
OL,8,Fa complaint about the finances of
OL,9,Findependence campaign Yes Scotland.
OL,11,FIn July, a Sunday newspaper published
OL,12,Fclaims by an activist that it was not
OL,13,Fknown how income of more than #1.5m had
OL,14,Fbeen spent.
OL,16,FHowever, Police Scotland say the
OL,17,Finformation passed to them has been
OL,18,Fassessed and there are no grounds for
OL,19,Ffurther inquiries.
